	(text "AERATOR BRANCH: P12V -> F7 -> J8 pin 1; pin 2 ground. Always on (not switched by brain).\nOne 12V / <0.4A diaphragm air pump (Amazon B089ZRYZV8), runs 24/7.\n1.5A fuse (same part as F6): verify motor startup does not open it.\nFit a check valve in the air line so water cannot siphon back into the pump."
