	(text "J1: pins 1-5 = +12V input; pins 6-10 = GND. Use all five 18AWG wires per polarity.\nJ4: pins 1-3 = fused +12V; pins 4-6 = COOL_NEG. Use all three 18AWG wires per polarity.\nEqual wire lengths and sound crimps required; validate contact current sharing / temperature.\nProvisional total continuous budget: 15A at room temperature; further derating in warm enclosure.\nFuses are provisional: F1 20A, F2 5A, F3 3A, F4 15A, F5 3A. No reverse-polarity blocking.\nSupply reported as 12V / 50A / 600W; confirm unit label and fault mode before release."
		(at 25.4 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15))
			(justify left))
		(uuid "6fd558a1-5f73-481b-8ce2-f4e0831bcf1e"))
