	(text "PRE-LAYOUT PART SELECTION - NOT FOR FABRICATION\nMPN, Manufacturer and Datasheet fields assigned to every purchased PCB part.\nAll soldered parts / connector tabs are surface mount; test points are bare copper.\nCurrent-dependent selections remain provisional until loads / temperature are measured.\nBrain supply is 3.3V ONLY. Verify it before connecting the brain.\n5V pump rail retained pending teammate driver update; fan branch F6/J7 added; heater removed from project.\nMain fuse requires PSU fault-mode verification; selective branch clearing not established.\nMating cable housings / contacts listed in connector properties; harness assembly separate.\nPCB copper, thermal performance, inrush and MLCC bias remain to be validated."
